<title>UK: LME copper hits stops above $2,440, zooms higher.</title>
<headline>LME copper hits stops above $2,440, zooms higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Races to $2,460 level after hitting stops above $2,440 after late Wednesday gains. Stock draw supportive.</p>
<p>ZINC - Hits fresh 4-1/2 year highs above $1,350.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Firmer just above $1,670 with copper.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Up some $100 over $7,800.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Firmer.</p>
</text>
